# Files the AI assistant must not read. Same syntax as .gitignore.
#
# This overlaps .gitignore today and that is not duplication: git is told not to
# COMMIT this file, the assistant is told not to READ it. Either rule can
# change without the other, so keep both, and keep this comment saying why.
#
# Scratch file written by the contextvibes CLI. It holds session working notes,
# not project content, and reading it would pollute the assistant's context.
contextvibes.md
